ga2J(){return'Track whether Supporter, Energy, and Retreat have been used this turn. Pressing "Turn End" resets these and shows a Pok\xe9mon Checkup dialog for Poison/Burn/Sleep on both players\' active Pok\xe9mon. Applying damage and resolving the coin toss are manual by default, but each can be automated from "Checkup automation" in Settings.'},
ga2I(){return"Match timer"},
ga2H(){return"The match timer is a single clock shared by both players. Starting, pausing, or resetting it from either side updates both displays. Resetting asks for confirmation first. You can change its initial duration in Settings."},
