ga2D(){return"Per-player defaults: In Settings, choose the bench slots, Lost Zone visibility, and marker type used when the next battle starts. During a battle, use Battle Display from the menu to change them for the current battle only.\nGX/VSTAR marker: tap the displayed marker to switch between used and unused.\nBench slots: normally 5, adjustable from 1\u20138 to match card effects and other formats.\nCustomization: Finish watching an optional rewarded ad to permanently unlock a battle background or theme color. All core features remain available without watching ads."},
